T ODO,"The standard tag for tasks, features, or improvements that need to be implemented later."
F IXME,"Used to mark code that is known to be broken, buggy, or in need of an urgent repair."
B UG,Specifically used to highlight an identified defect or error in the code that needs investigation.
H ACK,"Marks a ""quick and dirty"" solution or a temporary workaround that should ideally be cleaned up later."
X XX,"Often used to flag areas of code that are dangerous, confusing, or highly likely to cause issues (a ""warning"" tag)."